  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "直接把怪物生命改成零实现秒杀，或修改敌意变量把敌人转化为盟友",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Not only that, but you can also set a monster's HP to zero for an instant kill or alter its hostility to turn it into an ally.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3406850/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "用运算符与数值组成变量卡，加法恢复强化、减法削弱、乘法放大关键属性",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Utilize variable manipulation cards composed of operators and numerical values to directly alter character stats. Addition Card: Boost your attack power or recover lost health. Subtraction Card: Weaken the enemy's stats or reduce their health. Multiplication Card: Greatly amplify critical stats to turn the tide of battle in your favor.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3406850/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "变量卡还能压缩陷阱延迟、增强陷阱威力，甚至把来袭投射物伤害降为零",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "By creatively using variable cards, you can drastically reduce trap delay and boost their power to turn them against enemies, or even reduce incoming projectile damage to zero.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3406850/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
